Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:15.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看还是免了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think I'm gonna pass on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.71,0:01:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(我们在这里拥有很多  人  食物  药品  围墙  一切生存必需品)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:01:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滑了一跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在建新哨塔的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Building a new guard tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里现在好安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so quiet over there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从灾变一开始我就认识丹妮斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Denise since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮特还在的时候  她不太出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't around much before Pete, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前  她总是待在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}before that, she just stayed inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总是在读书\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was always-- was always reading something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在必要的时候站了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she really stepped up when she had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她为我们站了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was there for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是有意提起这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to bring it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直担心塔拉  担心她得知这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just keep thinking about Tara, when she finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣证明了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都证明了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会继续证明自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're all gonna keep coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬让我和格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie asked me and Glenn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮着安置更多的枪桶和哨岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help put up more bins and watch points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朱迪斯还没醒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith-- Judith isn't even up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  为什么不  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? Why not? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬给我们排好班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie has us on a schedule
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想惹一个怀孕的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not pissing off a pregnant lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:07:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别惹那个怀孕的女士  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not that pregnant lady. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她担心我们遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's worried about an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们来找我们  我们就终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they come for us, we'll end it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次跟以前不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't be like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're putting everything in place
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们现在知道该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these people know what to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们知道该如何拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we know how to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we need
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在墙内\N{\fnArial\fs30}is right here inside these walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会再失去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not losing any of it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.40,0:08:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些留着  但也应该藏几把\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have these, but we should hide a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话  我们找得到  外人找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, we can find them, but strangers can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防有人闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case anyone gets in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们闯不进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扯淡  具体去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, shit. You got specifics?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干他不该干的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something he shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:44.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去制止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给老子也腾个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make room for my freckled ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替我站岗  你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover my watch. You stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得有足够人手留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we should keep numbers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道达里尔要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where Daryl's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她什么时候离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time did she leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她带了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what she took?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是夜里离开的  我没听见她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime in the night. I never heard her go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她做了一大堆吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she made a bunch of food, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带走了她的背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took her pack,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-拿了我一件外套...  -她是步行离开的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- one of my coats-- - Did she leave on foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我十二点接的班  待到六点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I took over at 12:00, I was on till 6:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never saw anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们出去之后  前门一直没动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Front's been quiet since the others left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:10:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  谁出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  他出去找昨天那帮救世军寻仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl. He went ICBM after the Saviors from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.40,0:11:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  米琼恩  罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Michonne, Rosita,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都追出去阻止他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they all went to shut that shit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一辆车哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the other car?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们昨天多摆了两辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We added two more cars yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在有一辆不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them's missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是摆在那些房子中间的那辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one we put right between those houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从上面基本看不清那些房子中间的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can barely see between the houses from up top,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是在晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那张纸条  能给我看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The note, can I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没看见车头灯车尾灯亮起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never saw any headlights, taillights?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很聪明  知道如何掩藏踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's smart enough to cover her tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是趁着换班的时候溜走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must've left during the shift change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉卡尔我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Carl I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他任何人都不准离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全员做好战斗准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else stays ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你们别伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何大家总是把情况往最糟的方向想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does everyone always assume the worst?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从车里出来如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you come on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.60,0:13:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只有这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及一把对付行尸的小刀  没别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a knife for the dead ones, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:57.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你有情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naw, you got information.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如你是打哪里来的  要到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like where you're from, where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说嘛  这是个孤独的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it's a lonely world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们互相认识一下嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫希罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我谁也不是  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nobody, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫南希  来自蒙特克莱尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy from Montclair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我一直漂泊不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've bounced around a lot since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四处奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没从哪里来  也没打算到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really from anywhere. I'm not really going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们在一件事上达成了共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we agree on one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙特克莱尔来的南希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nancy from Montclair--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哪里也去不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你看起来确实像是从某个地方来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do seem like you're from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你离开蒙特克莱尔后  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Montclair, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈尔斯  那地方叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miles, what's that place called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个带栅门的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gated one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离这12.75公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}12.75 clicks down?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.57,0:15:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里的前门外停着一些车  插着木棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they got some cars out front, spikes through them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你开的这辆一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like the one you're driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手无寸铁  毫无防卫  一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}no weapons, no protection, no clue,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不应该一个人出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really shouldn't be out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正要去你们那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we were just on our way to your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以送你一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can give you a ride back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.67,0:15:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有你陪着  他们会让我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll let us in if you're with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以掉头回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could turn back and you could go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody has to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来有人要受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's looking like someone's gotta get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  不如趁现在抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, why don't you just grab her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免得她待会儿晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she passes out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢地出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看还是免了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna pass on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很疲倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have a lot to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  米琼恩和罗西塔追着达里尔出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn, Michonne, and Rosita just took off after Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要多轮一班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking an extra shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先来把午餐打包带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just packing a lunch before I go back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-回见  -你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you later. - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你休息时帮你轮班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your shift while you rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就几个小时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我帮忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好休息  吃点泡菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up your feet and eat some pickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用不着跟来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须试试  就算机会渺茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to try, even if it's a long shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算危机四伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮胎印是向东的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tire tracks pointed east...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去东面\N{\fnArial\fs30}we go east.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和队伍去的地方  那个救世军的基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saviors' compound that you and the group-- that you went to,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是西面\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was west.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来她去了东面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like she went east.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一点都不了解卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所信仰的  未必正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I believe-- I'm not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不存在所谓的正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.19,0:20:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只存在没有拖垮你的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just the wrong that doesn't pull you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它还没有拖垮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't pulled me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想它会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God dang--!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.23,0:21:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃吧伙计  别挣扎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let it go, man. Just let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.62,0:21:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是她的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.49,0:22:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军之前从山顶寨铁匠那拿过武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors were getting weapons from the Hilltop's blacksmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:22:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men were Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's blood here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:14.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could've been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.05,0:23:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为她感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她干掉了四个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took four of them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人  她非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman, she's a force of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她离开是因为她不能再杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left because she can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她信里是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what her letter said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她能的  因为她必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could because she had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.54,0:23:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些时候你必须这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对面有更多的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more blood opposite these men
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.45,0:23:48.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到田地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that leads into the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是卡萝尔留下的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trail. Could be Carol's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.65,0:23:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的枪很多都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of their guns are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-估计她拿走了  -还有这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She might've taken them. - Those, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有可能她死在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or she could've died here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.27,0:24:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便她现在不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if she isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.10,0:24:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踪迹向这边去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trail goes this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.97,0:24:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们离亚历山大很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were close to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还有更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's even more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.25,0:24:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没能斩草除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.05,0:24:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挑起了事端\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.71,0:25:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.61,0:25:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那他肯定是从这里开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so he had to start from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特往哪边跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way did Dwight run?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.14,0:26:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.88,0:26:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该让他放手去干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should let him do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.98,0:26:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他不知道他在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he doesn't know what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.11,0:26:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.73,0:26:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他这么做  现在是会让你心里好受点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe him trying this makes you feel better about it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这会让敌人对我们的了解越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they keep knowing more about us than we know about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.62,0:26:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许达里尔会害死自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe Daryl's gonna get himself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.05,0:26:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特往哪边跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way did Dwight run?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.28,0:27:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看清楚点人  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the hell out, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.81,0:27:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看清楚了  你们不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. You shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.45,0:27:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.71,0:27:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前跟萨沙和亚伯拉罕分开时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I split off from Sasha and Abraham,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.00,0:27:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和那帮女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was out there in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.09,0:27:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那片烧毁的森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that burned-out forest with them girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.61,0:27:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿枪抵着我头  把我绑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}put a gun to my head, tied me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.78,0:27:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时竟然想去帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even tried to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.28,0:27:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你觉得是你的错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you think it's your fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.89,0:27:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我知道就是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.36,0:27:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去做我一开始就该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go do what I should've done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  为了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.79,0:27:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为了自己才这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.20,0:28:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.53,0:28:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回家  再考虑这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to get back there and figure this out from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.64,0:28:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你  现在家里的人需要我们的保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you, and everyone back there needs us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.72,0:28:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面形势不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's-- it's gonna go wrong out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.72,0:28:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会报这个仇的  我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll square it. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.42,0:28:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.33,0:28:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.87,0:28:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl. - Man, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.51,0:28:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  那些人现在可能正往亚历山大去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing is, those men could be back in Alexandria right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.44,0:29:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们真去了  就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they are, they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.54,0:29:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要留他们活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.18,0:29:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得了解更多情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.42,0:29:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们遇到了彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got stuck with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.32,0:29:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算我们走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:42.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起想办法度难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured it all out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.63,0:29:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.59,0:29:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了这么多  真的以为做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.38,0:29:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可这个世界与我们想象的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's not what we thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.82,0:30:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山顶寨  救世军  更加复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilltop, the Saviors, it's bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.39,0:31:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血迹不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.64,0:31:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果这是卡萝尔的血  \N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's Carol's,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.71,0:31:08.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她失血有好一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then she's been bleeding for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这儿是因为卡萝尔是你的朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you out here because Carol is your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.29,0:31:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这儿是因为她是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out here 'cause she's my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.22,0:31:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在社区找人聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've talked to people back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.49,0:31:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道在监狱里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out about what happened at the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.43,0:31:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要驱逐她\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you sent her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了你的两个同伴  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed two of your people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.82,0:31:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧掉了他们的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burned their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这件事发生在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that had happened today?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.57,0:31:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会杀了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.18,0:31:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果发生在今天  我会谢谢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it happened today, I'd thank her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.28,0:31:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我会亲自杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I would've killed them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.68,0:31:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她那样做是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.35,0:31:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们当时病了  散播病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were sick, spreading a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.45,0:31:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们撑不下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.19,0:31:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但那时候与现在不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but this was back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.33,0:32:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也没有杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.33,0:32:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把她逐走了  瑞克  然后她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent her away, Rick, and she came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她回来了  救了你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she came back and she saved all y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.50,0:32:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人是可以回头的  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}People can come back, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.31,0:32:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.93,0:32:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她才死了不到一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}She couldn't have been dead more than a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.68,0:33:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  我不会惹什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm not trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.46,0:33:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想惹什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.55,0:33:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来  放下你的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.24,0:33:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.11,0:33:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些行尸太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wasted are too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.08,0:33:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在找我的马  你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just looking for my horse. Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.29,0:33:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.12,0:33:37.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找朋友  你看到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for our friend. Have you seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.65,0:33:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.29,0:33:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.77,0:33:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.23,0:33:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.62,0:34:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.16,0:34:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.76,0:34:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  是山顶寨的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's one of the Hilltop's.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.23,0:34:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像路上的那根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the one on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.74,0:34:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他是救世军的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.34,0:34:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他也在找卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's looking for Carol, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.02,0:34:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许那个人只是在找一匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the man is just looking for a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.04,0:34:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他是山顶寨的人  也许他是其他地方的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he is from Hilltop. Maybe he's from somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.45,0:34:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不会再冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take chances anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.30,0:34:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些狼群\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Wolves...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们袭击后  我找到了其中一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}after they attacked, I found one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.01,0:35:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前去找你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had attacked me on the road before,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在路上袭击过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was trying to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.61,0:35:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我阻止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.03,0:35:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我放他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I let him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.76,0:35:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击过后  他又出现在亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he was there in Alexandria after the attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.27,0:35:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲在某个褐石屋里  我又阻止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding in one of the brownstones, so I stopped him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他击晕了  本来可以杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knocked him out and I could have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.66,0:35:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但所有生命都是宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But all life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.61,0:35:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他关在褐石屋的地下室中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in the cell of the brownstone basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.77,0:35:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道他会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I knew he could change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.62,0:35:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.91,0:35:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你在社区里关了一个活的  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You had one of them alive in the community? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.14,0:35:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当墙倒下行尸进来时  卡萝尔发现了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the walls came down and the walkers broke in, Carol found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.40,0:35:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们打斗了  那个人逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought and that man escaped,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.78,0:36:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而丹妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Denise...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.72,0:36:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她来牢房治疗他\N{\fnArial\fs30}she had come to the cell to try and help him
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.54,0:36:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他抓做人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he took her hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后她和那只狼被行尸包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she and that Wolf, they got swarmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.73,0:36:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人  那个杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that man, that killer,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.11,0:36:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他救了她的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}he saved her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.32,0:36:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后丹妮斯才能救了卡尔的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Denise was there to save Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.49,0:36:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.22,0:36:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一场轮回\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all a circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.34,0:36:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都有因果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything gets a return.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.80,0:36:40.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事实就是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the fact is the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.84,0:36:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实那样做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.48,0:36:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我留了他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.82,0:36:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回家吧  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go home, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.91,0:36:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开上车  家里需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the car. You're needed back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.75,0:37:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该在外面冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be out here taking any more chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.14,0:37:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.97,0:37:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡萝尔还在外面  -我会找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carol's still out here. - And I will find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.26,0:37:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.67,0:37:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.98,0:37:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.14,0:37:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.60,0:37:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我没回来  别来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I don't, don't come looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.80,0:37:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.27,0:37:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  我...  -拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I-- - Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.79,0:37:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那根蛋白棒的确是米琼恩偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne did steal that protein bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.73,0:38:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.82,0:38:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩根还在外面找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morgan's still out there looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.45,0:38:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Michonne here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.42,0:38:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也还在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still out there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.40,0:38:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.11,0:38:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go back to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.91,0:38:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟某人太亲近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let somebody close?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.32,0:39:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.16,0:39:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.86,0:39:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.34,0:39:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm that much more ready
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这世界再捅个窟窿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tear the world a brand-new asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.45,0:39:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.66,0:39:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.26,0:39:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.15,0:40:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特说你在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott said you were looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.36,0:40:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.52,0:40:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.78,0:40:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.83,0:40:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.85,0:40:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.97,0:40:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让任何东西妨碍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want anything getting in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.19,0:40:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  我剪太短了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, did I go too short?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只给我爸爸剪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I only used to cut my dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.62,0:41:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是因为那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.46,0:41:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.46,0:41:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.75,0:41:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.89,0:42:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.
